# vergeio_nas_cifs_share (Resource)

`vergeio_nas_cifs_share` is a CIFS share on a `vergeio_nas_volume`. Set `volume_id` to that volume id so Terraform removes this share before the volume.

User and host lists use the form VergeOS stores, one entry on each line. If creating the share succeeds and a later read fails, Terraform deletes the share so it cannot block volume destroy.

